Z||000000||BENGAL4||05-21-2000||08:51 PM||||I went to the gas station to get some fuel for the lawn mower and on my way home I noticed an 86GT at the stop light. I looked over and it seemed OK until I saw the wheels. I had little bitty white walls with chrome wheels. The tires stuck out about 3 inches from the fender wells. It looked like a roller skate. I wanted to shout something obscene, but I figured to each his own. I am sure he had some go fast stickers on there somewhere. he ought to be arrested for Fiero abuse.||||reg||8
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||05-21-2000||09:11 PM||||The guy probably just traded off his Elantra and couldn't think of any thing better to do with the ugly little tires and wheels...lol||||reg||6
