Z||000003||Oreif||05-21-2000||10:28 PM||||Don't worry he won't be driving it long. As soon as the CV joint bearings wear away he'll be looking for another car to screw up. Putting the wrong offset wheels that far out puts way too much stress on the CV joints. I have seen other cars where the wheel assembly came off after the CV ate itself.||||reg||1
